ing, some of the severance we incurred this quarter, we really want to actually even start to feel the run rate of that expense benefit until late next quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/04/25/sei-investments-company-seic-q1-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"SEIC 2019 Q2","e":"seic","d":"2019-07-24","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Wayne M. Withrow","x":"Also included in these results are increased direct costs tied to our asset growth and savings in the technology area tied to the completion of the migration and implementation of the cost savings measures we began in the first quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/24/sei-investments-company-seic-q2-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"SEIC 2019 Q2","e":"seic","d":"2019-07-24","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Wayne M. Withrow","x":"Our profit increased $2.7 million from last year's second quarter due to cost savings.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/24/sei-investments-company-seic-q2-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"SEIC 2019 Q3","e":"seic","d":"2019-10-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Stephen M. Onofrio","x":"Our profits increased $2.2 million from last year's third quarter due to cost savings, assets under management were essentially flat from the third quarter of 2018 with market appreciation being offset by negative cash flow.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/23/sei-investments-company-seic-q3-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"SEIC 2020 Q3","e":"seic","d":"2020-10-21","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Dennis J. McGonigle","x":"So Al, with that, I'll now pass it on to Steve to talk about the private banking segment.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/22/sei-investments-company-seic-q3-2020-earnings-call/"},{"c":"SEIC 2020 Q3","e":"seic","d":"2020-10-21","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Dennis J. McGonigle","x":"The final 30% or approximately $4.5 million is essentially one-time in nature, related to some severance expense and professional services fees and costs associated with trade corrections as a result of a couple of incidents disclosed in our second quarter 10-Q. These costs are spread across our…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/22/sei-investments-company-seic-q3-2020-earnings-call/"},{"c":"SEIC 2020 Q3","e":"seic","d":"2020-10-21","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Dennis J. McGonigle","x":"Probably a combination of G&A, some in probably more investment managers and then, the severance was an institution.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/22/sei-investments-company-seic-q3-2020-earnings-call/"},{"c":"SEIC 2021 Q1","e":"seic","d":"2021-04-21","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Steve Meyer","x":"…we're still focused and ironically, we think this is good for us because Wells is normalizing and rightsizing their business for the future and I think once they do that and get to -- and if they are getting to a good spot, we'll be able to engage them on how SEI can continue to support them and…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/21/sei-investments-company-seic-q1-2021-earnings-call/"},{"c":"SEIC 2021 Q2","e":"seic","d":"2021-07-21","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Dennis J. McGonigle","x":"Corporately, our expenses during the quarter included approximately $1.9 million of severance expense, which was recorded in the impacted business segments and approximately $5.6 million related to sub-advisor expense tied to revenue growth.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/21/sei-investments-co-seic-q2-2021-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"SEIC 2021 Q2","e":"seic","d":"2021-07-21","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Dennis J. McGonigle","x":"There is a couple of things I pointed out that in the quarter as a company, we incurred $1.9 million of severance expense.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/21/sei-investments-co-seic-q2-2021-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"SEIC 2021 Q3","e":"seic","d":"2021-10-20","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Wayne M. Withrow","x":"With that, I will pass it on to Paul.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/20/sei-investments-co-seic-q3-2021-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"SEIC 2021 Q3","e":"seic","d":"2021-10-20","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Steve Meyer","x":"We still have some things to navigate through that I mentioned through the year, plus we're getting to that sustainable margin, really the two main pieces are us matriculating that $72 million as well as us managing and looking to right-size certain expenses.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/20/sei-investments-co-seic-q3-2021-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"SEIC 2025 Q2","e":"seic","d":"2025-07-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Ryan Hicke","x":"We will remain surgical on hiring, we will reprioritize certain discretionary spend, and we'll continue to streamline internal processes to ensure we're allocating resources where they'll have the greatest impact.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/07/23/sei-investments-seic-q2-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"SEIC 2025 Q2","e":"seic","d":"2025-07-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Sean Denham","x":"From a technology standpoint, we're investing for IMS, for instance, we're investing in technology to streamline our IMS systems for better scalability and cost efficiencies.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/07/23/sei-investments-seic-q2-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"SEIC 2025 Q3","e":"seic","d":"2025-10-22","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Sean Denham","x":"These gains were offset by $0.02 of M&A expense tied to our planned acquisition of Stratos and $0.02 of severance expense related to cost optimization initiatives.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/22/sei-investments-seic-q3-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"SEIC 2025 Q3","e":"seic","d":"2025-10-22","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Sean Denham","x":"Finally, we incurred severance costs of nearly $4 million this quarter, reflecting our commitment to supporting employees through transitions as we continue to evolve our business.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/22/sei-investments-seic-q3-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"SEIC 2025 Q4","e":"seic","d":"2026-01-28","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Ryan Hicke","x":"For instance, in the fourth quarter, we made a strategic investment in the band, an AI-native operating system for client onboarding.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/28/sei-investments-seic-q4-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"SEIC 2025 Q4","e":"seic","d":"2026-01-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Sean Denham","x":"Those items included $20 million of elevated corporate overhead expense related to severance and M&A fees incurred in the quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/28/sei-investments-seic-q4-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"SEIC 2025 Q4","e":"seic","d":"2026-01-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Sean Denham","x":"Consolidated operating margins were weighed down by severance and M&A costs captured in corporate overhead.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/28/sei-investments-seic-q4-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"SEIC 2026 Q1","e":"seic","d":"2026-04-22","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Ryan Hicke","x":"The partnership we recently announced with IBM reinforces and accelerates the direction we are taking around infrastructure modernization, automation and responsible AI deployment.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/23/sei-investments-seic-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"SEIC 2026 Q1","e":"seic","d":"2026-04-22","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Ryan Hicke","x":"We have been proactive, investing over the past 2 years in AI native capabilities, automation and AI-enabled expansions and extensions across our platforms.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/23/sei-investments-seic-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"SEIC 2026 Q1","e":"seic","d":"2026-04-22","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Ryan Hicke","x":"The reduction in workforce had little to no impact really specifically in banking.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/23/sei-investments-seic-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"SEIC 2026 Q1","e":"seic","d":"2026-04-22","l":"ai_disruption","r":"analyst","s":"Ryan Kenny","x":"So could you just dive a little deeper on how you view yourself as more protected from AI disintermediation?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/23/sei-investments-seic-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"SEIC 2026 Q1","e":"seic","d":"2026-04-22","l":"ai_disruption","r":"analyst","s":"Patrick O'Shaughnessy","x":"How are you guys thinking about AI potentially disrupting the wealth management advice industry broadly in terms of disintermediating your clients, whether it's AI native software or something else?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/23/sei-investments-seic-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"SEIC 2026 Q3","e":"seic","d":"2026-10-21","l":"ai_spend","r":"analyst","s":"Ryan Kenny","x":"We are investing in automation, in AI, and that is helping us to fast-track the overall onboarding process.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/10/21/sei-seic-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SEIC 2026 Q3","e":"seic","d":"2026-10-21","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Ryan Hicke","x":"Adjusted operating margins in the third quarter remained near record levels, and this was not driven by some short-sighted cost-cutting initiative.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/10/21/sei-seic-q3-202